  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of resilient local food systems through a school-based feeding social protection programme approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The joint programme promotes the strengthening of local food production capacities, in line with SDG 2, with a primary focus on strengthening and connecting smallholder farmers, including women farmers, to agricultural technical schools (ETAs by its Spanish acronym), due to their potential to produce continuously larger quantities of food.</narrative>
  </description>
